{"name":"Overgrowth","hex":"#88cc33","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"overgrowth","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A usually abundant, luxuriant growth over or on something else.\nA tangle of growth occurring at the top of trees involving vines and branches, common in jungles.","A tangle of growth occurring at the top of trees involving vines and branches, common in jungles."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/overgrowth"}],"entries":[{"title":"Shrub","blocks":[{"text":"A shrub or bush is a small to medium-sized perennial woody plant. Unlike herbaceous plants, shrubs have persistent woody stems above the ground. Shrubs can be either deciduous or evergreen. They are distinguished from trees by their multiple stems and shorter height, less than 6–10 m (20–33 ft) tall, the cutoff point varying within this range for any one species due to suitability of growing conditions in any one environment. Some tree species never achieve their mature height because of hostile, less than ideal growing conditions in certain areas, and can resemble shrub-sized plants. Small shrubs, less than 2 m (6.6 ft) tall are sometimes termed as subshrubs. Some shrub species only last about five years in good conditions, while others, usually larger and more woody, live beyond 70 years; on average, shrub species die after about eight years."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e0/Cytisus_scoparius2.jpg/330px-Cytisus_scoparius2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shrub","wikidata":"Q42295"},{"title":"Periphyton","blocks":[{"text":"Periphyton is a complex mixture of algae, cyanobacteria, heterotrophic microbes, and detritus that is attached to submerged surfaces in most aquatic ecosystems. The related term aufwuchs refers to the collection of small animals and plants that adhere to open surfaces in aquatic environments, such as parts of rooted plants."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/53/Periphyton.jpg/330px-Periphyton.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Periphyton","wikidata":"Q1858004"},{"title":"Overgrowth (video game)","blocks":[{"text":"Overgrowth is an action video game released by Wolfire Games available for Microsoft Windows, macOS and Linux. It was announced on September 17, 2008, and released on October 16, 2017, after 9 years of development and early access."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/1/19/Overgrowthlogo.png/330px-Overgrowthlogo.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Overgrowth_(video_game)","wikidata":"Q2002866"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/78/Sheringham_Park_1.JPG/500px-Sheringham_Park_1.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/78/Sheringham_Park_1.JPG/1280px-Sheringham_Park_1.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/78/Sheringham_Park_1.JPG/500px-Sheringham_Park_1.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A rhododendron shrubbery in Sheringham Park","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASheringham_Park_1.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/20/Scrub_brush_vegetation_in_south_TX_IMG_6069.JPG/500px-Scrub_brush_vegetation_in_south_TX_IMG_6069.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/20/Scrub_brush_vegetation_in_south_TX_IMG_6069.JPG/1280px-Scrub_brush_vegetation_in_south_TX_IMG_6069.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.o